{"format":"chengxi-course-pack-v1","title":"第2课：学习与记忆","lesson":2,"instructions":{"review":["annual","dependent","independent","adequate","dissatisfaction","sophisticated"],"new_words":6,"grammar_questions":5,"suggested_minutes":25},"words":[{"word":"effort","ipa":"/ˈefərt/","meaning":"努力；力气","phrase":"make an effort 努力","tag":"第2课"},{"word":"habit","ipa":"/ˈhæbɪt/","meaning":"习惯","phrase":"develop a habit 养成习惯","tag":"第2课"},{"word":"focus","ipa":"/ˈfoʊkəs/","meaning":"集中；焦点","phrase":"focus on 专注于","tag":"第2课"},{"word":"remember","ipa":"/rɪˈmembər/","meaning":"记得；记住","phrase":"remember to do 记得去做","tag":"第2课"},{"word":"review","ipa":"/rɪˈvjuː/","meaning":"复习；回顾","phrase":"review vocabulary 复习词汇","tag":"第2课"},{"word":"mistake","ipa":"/mɪˈsteɪk/","meaning":"错误","phrase":"make a mistake 犯错误","tag":"第2课"}],"grammar":[{"q":"I ___ an effort to learn English every day.","options":["make","am","makes"],"answer":"make","note":"主语 I 后用动词原形；make an effort 是固定搭配。"},{"q":"Please focus ___ the question.","options":["on","in","at"],"answer":"on","note":"固定搭配 focus on，表示“专注于”。"},{"q":"She ___ a good study habit.","options":["has","have","is"],"answer":"has","note":"主语 She 是第三人称单数，have 要变成 has。"},{"q":"Remember ___ review these words tonight.","options":["to","on","for"],"answer":"to","note":"remember to do 表示“记得去做某事”。"},{"q":"Mistakes ___ part of learning.","options":["are","is","am"],"answer":"are","note":"Mistakes 是复数，be 动词用 are。"}]}